This licence covers the CODE ONLY.

The CP-AnemiC dataset is not part of this repository and is not covered here.
It is distributed by its own authors under its own terms:

  Appiahene et al., "CP-AnemiC: A conjunctival pallor dataset and benchmark
  for anemia detection in children", Medicine in Novel Technology and
  Devices 18 (2023) 100244.

The images are clinical photographs of children aged 6-59 months. Obtain them
from the original source and respect the conditions attached to them.

Nothing in this repository is a medical device or a diagnosis. It is a
screening-signal experiment; lab hemoglobin remains the reference standard.
